msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"Six years of my brother's life have been stolen away because\r\n"
"of false charges! I'm asking for any help I can get to save\r\n"
"his life from unjust imprisonment!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "It can't be her..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "Read the truth!"
msgstr "Leggi la verità!"

msgctxt "228"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "Hey."
msgstr "Ehi."

msgctxt "252"
msgid "Oh, Kiryu-san."
msgstr "Quindi, Kiryu-san."

msgctxt "264"
msgid "What are you doing standing around here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "And who's that? What's she handing out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "I think they're⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "Hey, you over there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "I knew it! It <Italic>is</Italic> you! You're that journalist!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "Um, uh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid "Look what happened to my brother, thanks to you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "What happened?"
msgstr "Che è successo?"

msgctxt "372"
msgid "I never intended for that to, um..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"Journalists only care about themselves. Do you have any\r\n"
"idea what horrible things happen to the people you write\r\n"
"about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "I, uh..."
msgstr "Io, uhm..."

msgctxt "408"
msgid "My brother didn't kill anybody!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "Sounds like you two have quite the past."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr "Già..."

msgctxt "468"
msgid "What happened, exactly?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid "Maybe we should talk someplace else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr "Certo."

